WEBVTT

00:04.087 --> 00:06.167
<b>Oh great and mighty king,</b>

00:06.167 --> 00:10.577
<b>you do me a great honor by granting me 
this audience with you here in this place.</b>

00:10.997 --> 00:16.247
<b>Now, would you please be so kind as to tell 
me everything you know about our facilities?</b>

00:16.247 --> 00:18.087
<b>We want you to use it.</b>

00:18.087 --> 00:20.497
<b>It's a special plate that's 
the same as everyone else's!</b>

00:24.407 --> 00:26.087
<b>We have these dreams.</b>

00:26.087 --> 00:28.097
<b>Dreams of fun times.</b>

00:28.097 --> 00:29.967
<b>Dreams of our mother.</b>

00:29.967 --> 00:32.807
<b>Then we wake up and
remember that it's all gone,</b>

00:32.807 --> 00:35.637
<b>and it hurts so much.</b>

00:35.637 --> 00:37.557
<b>I just had a great idea!</b>

00:37.557 --> 00:41.317
<b>Why don't I sleep with you two from now on?</b>

00:42.007 --> 00:45.647
<b>I'll always be here for you two.</b>

00:46.547 --> 00:48.587
<b>So rest easy.</b>

00:48.587 --> 00:52.827
<b>Now, come sleep in your Isla's arms.</b>

00:53.287 --> 00:57.007
<b>What's going on with little Atou now?</b>

00:57.007 --> 01:01.657
<b>It looks like she's 
in a pretty amusing situation.</b>

01:21.407 --> 01:23.857
<b>Yes, yes, good hunting.</b>

01:23.857 --> 01:24.927
<b>I'm finished.</b>

01:24.927 --> 01:26.887
<b>Th-Thank you!</b>

01:26.887 --> 01:29.197
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

01:29.737 --> 01:32.197
<b>Um, Mayor Antelise?</b>

01:32.197 --> 01:34.887
<b>Y-Yes?! What is it?!</b>

01:34.887 --> 01:40.107
<b>Oh, that reminds me, I became good friends 
with the Elfuur sisters from your nation!</b>

01:40.107 --> 01:42.517
<b>Err, not that there's any reason 
to tell you that right now!</b>

01:42.517 --> 01:44.957
<b>P-Perhaps you should rest a bit?</b>

01:44.957 --> 01:47.677
<b>You can leave matters here to me.</b>

01:47.677 --> 01:48.667
<b>I-In that case!</b>

01:48.667 --> 01:50.177
<b>I'll gladly do that!</b>

01:50.177 --> 01:51.267
<b>Thank you!</b>

01:51.267 --> 01:53.677
<b>Thank you! Thank you!</b>

01:57.527 --> 01:59.367
<b>King Takuto...</b>

01:59.367 --> 02:02.187
<b>I want to go home to Mynoghra already...</b>

03:36.527 --> 03:37.987
Go Forth and Conquer

03:42.397 --> 03:43.787
<b>Here you go.</b>

03:45.227 --> 03:46.807
<b>Thank you.</b>

03:46.807 --> 03:49.377
<b>We've really integrated 
well with these people.</b>

03:49.767 --> 03:52.687
<b>I thought they would be more fearful of us,</b>

03:52.687 --> 03:54.967
<b>but I suppose we have Sir Pepe to thank.</b>

03:57.627 --> 03:59.717
<b>Wow! You're like an octopus!</b>

04:00.047 --> 04:01.067
<b>Octopus?</b>

04:01.807 --> 04:05.767
<b>Octopatou</b>

04:02.147 --> 04:03.007
<b>Octopus?</b>

04:03.007 --> 04:04.557
<b>It's kind of octopus-like.</b>

04:04.557 --> 04:05.767
<b>She's an octopus!</b>

04:05.767 --> 04:07.267
<b>Excuse me! That's not—</b>

04:07.267 --> 04:08.827
<b>That's so reassuring!</b>

04:08.827 --> 04:11.357
<b>Atou, I'll be entrusting Dragontan to you!</b>

04:11.357 --> 04:14.607
<b>Since I have to return to Crescent Moon!</b>

04:14.607 --> 04:15.687
<b>Later!</b>

04:15.687 --> 04:17.107
<b>Hey! Pepe?!</b>

04:18.057 --> 04:20.517
<b><i>Why was he calling me an octopus?</i></b>

04:20.517 --> 04:23.257
<b><i>Well, refuting it is too much trouble,</i></b>

04:23.257 --> 04:25.427
<b><i>so I don't care anymore...</i></b>

04:25.427 --> 04:28.127
<b><i>But really, an octopus?</i></b>

04:28.407 --> 04:31.067
<b>By the way, Lady Atou.</b>

04:31.067 --> 04:32.427
<b>What is it?</b>

04:32.427 --> 04:37.087
<b>How goes your plundering of 
abilities from those Barbarians?</b>

04:37.527 --> 04:40.847
<b>Oh, that's proceeding smoothly.</b>

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 90 0 90

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 2 0 2

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
<b>Sludge Atou</b>

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
<b>Combat Unit</b>

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
<b>Ruin Affinity +2
 Darkness Affinity +1
 Chaos Affinity +1
 Evil Hero Zealot</b>

04:40.847 --> 04:47.557
*This unit has a set chance of obtaining the 
abilities of units it defeats.

04:42.097 --> 04:47.557
<b>Despite being weaklings, that lot has 
better abilities than they deserve.</b>

04:44.017 --> 04:47.557
<b>Outdoor Survival
 Enhanced Stamina
 Enhanced Strength Regeneration
 Stone Skin</b>

04:49.047 --> 04:50.387
<b>Well, well,</b>

04:50.387 --> 04:53.527
<b>I'm sure our king will be 
delighted to hear that.</b>

04:53.527 --> 04:55.267
<b>Yes! Yes!</b>

04:55.267 --> 04:58.547
<b>King Takuto already praised me for it!</b>

04:58.547 --> 05:03.287
<b>And when I get home, I'll have 
him praise me even more!</b>

05:07.337 --> 05:09.797
<b>That's a Hill Giant, isn't it?</b>

05:10.307 --> 05:11.207
<b>Moltar?</b>

05:11.617 --> 05:14.087
<b>There were no signs of magic.</b>

05:14.087 --> 05:16.927
<b>I didn't even sense the use of Mana.</b>

05:18.037 --> 05:22.697
<b>I'd like to uncover the trick behind 
these sudden appearances soon.</b>

05:22.697 --> 05:26.637
<b>As things stand now, I'll never 
be able to return to King Takuto.</b>

05:26.637 --> 05:28.117
<b>Indeed.</b>

05:30.617 --> 05:32.887
<b>Atou! There's a Hill Giant!</b>

05:32.887 --> 05:34.467
<b>I have the archers preparing quickly—</b>

05:34.467 --> 05:36.007
<b>There's no need.</b>

05:36.007 --> 05:37.757
<b>I'll be enough by myself.</b>

05:37.757 --> 05:39.527
<b>But then—</b>

05:47.837 --> 05:49.117
<b>Atou?!</b>

05:49.117 --> 05:51.877
<b>You don't need to worry about 
her against something that weak.</b>

05:51.877 --> 05:53.687
<b>That weak?!</b>

05:53.687 --> 05:56.007
<b>Lady Atou is a Hero.</b>

05:56.007 --> 05:59.757
<b>That said, just watching 
would be rather dull.</b>

06:00.017 --> 06:05.277
<b>Perhaps I'll go put these 
old bones to work a bit too.</b>

06:06.667 --> 06:09.317
<b>Elder Moltar, what are you...?</b>

06:16.917 --> 06:19.207
<b>Land of Ruin!</b>

06:25.257 --> 06:26.507
<b>What was that?!</b>

06:26.507 --> 06:30.077
<b>Let's just say it's a national secret.</b>

06:34.977 --> 06:36.957
<b>Elder Moltar, huh?</b>

06:36.957 --> 06:38.587
<b>What a clever move.</b>

06:40.087 --> 06:45.007
Military Magic: "Land of Ruin"

06:40.087 --> 06:45.007
Buffs strength of evil-aligned units within range.

06:40.087 --> 06:45.007
Debuffs strength of non-evil-aligned units within range

06:49.727 --> 06:51.807
<b>Good afternoon. Die.</b>

06:55.237 --> 06:58.777
<b>These Holy Sword Arts 
really are handy.</b>

07:00.867 --> 07:01.737
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:05.877 --> 07:07.287
<b><i>Gold coins?</i></b>

07:09.347 --> 07:10.137
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

07:10.137 --> 07:12.677
<b><i>When I defeated the Hill Giant just now,</i></b>

07:12.677 --> 07:14.767
<b><i>its corpse disappeared, and in its place...</i></b>

07:14.767 --> 07:16.547
<b><i>Its corpse disappeared?</i></b>

07:16.907 --> 07:19.827
<b><i>Yes. I asked Elder Moltar as well,</i></b>

07:19.827 --> 07:22.007
<b><i>but he said this was a first for him too.</i></b>

07:23.417 --> 07:26.717
<b><i>He even said that he had never 
seen the gold coins before either.</i></b>

07:27.687 --> 07:29.937
<b><i>Atou, I'll use Shared Perception.</i></b>

07:29.937 --> 07:31.337
<b><i>I want to check something.</i></b>

07:37.177 --> 07:38.977
<b><i>This crest...</i></b>

07:38.977 --> 07:40.347
<b><i>Where have I...?</i></b>

07:47.737 --> 07:49.697
<b><i>Brave Questus</i>!</b>

07:50.487 --> 07:51.697
<b>Master?</b>

08:10.497 --> 08:12.937
<b>Our enemy is an RPG!</b>

08:13.187 --> 08:19.937
<b>The Demon Lord's Army
 Has Appeared!</b>

08:26.467 --> 08:27.717
<b>How awful.</b>

08:27.717 --> 08:28.837
<b>Damn Witch!</b>

08:28.837 --> 08:31.197
<b>How many cities does she intend to destroy?!</b>

08:31.557 --> 08:33.967
<b>There might be survivors.</b>

08:33.967 --> 08:35.447
<b>Let's search for them.</b>

08:35.447 --> 08:36.547
<b>Roger tha—!</b>

08:42.287 --> 08:44.967
<b>Rattle, roll, rattle, roll.</b>

08:45.287 --> 08:48.047
<b>Life is all just killing time.</b>

08:48.047 --> 08:49.427
<b>We die and die and die,</b>

08:49.427 --> 08:51.967
<b>so let's have fun dying again!</b>

08:55.327 --> 08:57.077
<b>Hey there, Sainty!</b>

08:57.077 --> 08:59.127
<b>Nice to meet you, and long time no see!</b>

08:59.127 --> 09:00.317
<b>You doing well?</b>

09:00.727 --> 09:03.057
<b>The Slurping Witch, Erakino.</b>

09:03.057 --> 09:07.207
<b>We've executed divine judgment 
upon you seventeen times already,</b>

09:07.207 --> 09:12.327
<b>and they all succeeded 
thanks to our sacrifices.</b>

09:12.727 --> 09:14.957
<b>So why won't you just die?</b>

09:15.417 --> 09:17.047
<b>Well, I am dying!</b>

09:17.047 --> 09:19.167
<b>You've killed me seventeen times, right?!</b>

09:19.167 --> 09:23.097
<b>So I've died seventeen times! Uh-huh!</b>

09:23.097 --> 09:25.167
<b>Then how are you still here?</b>

09:25.167 --> 09:27.177
<b>I wonder how, too!</b>

09:28.937 --> 09:31.817
<b>I mean, aren't you a bit too strong, Sainty?</b>

09:31.817 --> 09:35.557
<b>I'm rather on the strong side myself, 
despite how I may look, you know?</b>

09:35.957 --> 09:38.577
<b>Yet you've killed me every time.</b>

09:38.577 --> 09:41.557
<b>I'm starting to wonder if 
you're a death flag for me.</b>

09:41.557 --> 09:43.777
<b>Why do I need over fourteen every time?</b>

09:43.777 --> 09:47.107
<b>You're trying to accomplish 
something, aren't you, Erakino?</b>

09:50.117 --> 09:54.077
<b>I still don't know what that might be yet.</b>

09:54.077 --> 09:55.237
<b>However,</b>

09:55.237 --> 09:58.787
<b>that power has something to do with 
your resurrections, doesn't it?</b>

10:00.097 --> 10:02.537
<b>This is the problem with a goody-two-shoes.</b>

10:02.537 --> 10:04.437
<b>Oh well!</b>

10:04.437 --> 10:07.047
<b>Come on, all of my simps!</b>

10:07.047 --> 10:09.577
<b>It's your turn!</b>

10:15.577 --> 10:16.947
<b>What an atrocity.</b>

10:17.427 --> 10:18.937
<b>Go on!</b>

10:18.937 --> 10:21.287
<b>Charge!</b>

10:23.097 --> 10:24.267
<b>You're sentenced to a blooming burial!</b>

10:43.997 --> 10:45.587
<b>No way!</b>

10:48.257 --> 10:51.217
<b>You really are too strong, Sainty.</b>

10:51.217 --> 10:53.387
<b>This game's too hard.</b>

10:53.387 --> 10:54.427
<b>Slump.</b>

10:57.687 --> 10:59.687
<b>The eighteenth time.</b>

10:59.687 --> 11:02.367
<b>This should at least buy 
us some time for a while.</b>

11:04.737 --> 11:09.737
<b>Holy God Arlos, what is going on here?</b>

11:15.097 --> 11:17.507
<b>Where did such a huge army come from?!</b>

11:17.507 --> 11:21.277
<b>M-Messengers! Hurry up and 
inform Mayor Antelise!</b>

11:22.927 --> 11:25.357
<b><i>Our enemy is the orthodox JRPG</i></b>

11:25.357 --> 11:27.247
<b><i></i>Brave Questus<i>.</i></b>

11:27.597 --> 11:31.397
<b><i>You play as the Hero and go on an 
adventure with your party</i></b>

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Takuto

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Command

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Fight

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Spell

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Run

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
Item

11:30.047 --> 11:32.717
<b>Troll</b>

11:31.397 --> 11:34.957
<b><i>to defeat the final boss, the 
Demon Lord, and save the world.</i></b>

11:34.957 --> 11:38.847
<b><i>It's a famous game that's said to 
be the progenitor of most PC RPGs.</i></b>

11:39.287 --> 11:41.047
<b><i>An RPG?</i></b>

11:41.047 --> 11:43.847
<b><i>Then you mean the reason they 
suddenly appeared was—</i></b>

11:43.847 --> 11:44.937
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

11:44.937 --> 11:49.927
<b><i>Because there's no warning for the random 
encounters with enemies in </i>Brave Questus<i>.</i></b>

11:49.927 --> 11:51.947
<b>I'm thinking they took advantage of that.</b>

11:52.297 --> 11:57.357
<b>I had feared there might be 
other beings similar to us,</b>

11:57.357 --> 12:00.407
<b>but I never expected they'd come from 
an entirely different genre of game.</b>

12:00.717 --> 12:03.637
<b>The odds were likely enough.</b>

12:03.637 --> 12:04.997
<b>"Witches."</b>

12:04.997 --> 12:08.877
<b>That information we gained from that 
paladin revealed the name of a unit</b>

12:08.877 --> 12:10.867
<b>that was never part of <i>Eternal Nations</i>.</b>

12:13.037 --> 12:14.627
<b>Still, Master,</b>

12:14.627 --> 12:18.427
<b>you've played <i>Brave Questus</i> before, right?</b>

12:18.427 --> 12:22.887
<b>So that means you already know 
how we can conquer our enemy.</b>

12:23.147 --> 12:24.647
<b>Exactly.</b>

12:24.647 --> 12:26.397
<b><i>Atou, can you hear me?</i></b>

12:26.707 --> 12:28.997
<b><i>Of course, King Takuto!</i></b>

12:28.997 --> 12:31.897
<b><i>I'm going to tell you how 
to conquer our enemy now.</i></b>

12:32.637 --> 12:33.477
<b>Yes!</b>

12:40.257 --> 12:42.227
<b>Go forth and conquer.</b>

12:47.487 --> 12:51.517
<b>Flamin, did the Demon Lord issue any orders?</b>

12:52.627 --> 12:54.167
<b>Yeah, he did, Ice Rock!</b>

12:54.167 --> 12:56.637
<b>Same as always. Nothing new!</b>

12:56.637 --> 12:58.347
<b>I see.</b>

12:58.827 --> 13:00.467
<b>All the monsters, all the tactics!</b>

13:00.467 --> 13:03.507
<b>They're all free for us 
to command as we please!</b>

13:03.507 --> 13:04.667
<b>What?!</b>

13:04.667 --> 13:07.767
<b>Such faith in us must be rewarded!</b>

13:07.767 --> 13:10.397
<b>We have been most fortunate though.</b>

13:10.397 --> 13:13.277
<b>After we were suddenly summoned to this land,</b>

13:13.277 --> 13:18.037
<b>all of its Orcs and Goblins have 
joined our Demon Lord's forces.</b>

13:18.887 --> 13:20.467
<b>The world may be different,</b>

13:20.467 --> 13:23.367
<b>but our Demon Lord's majesty hasn't waned!</b>

13:23.677 --> 13:26.337
<b>Yes, as expected from our great ruler.</b>

13:26.337 --> 13:29.557
<b>He's truly the one fit to govern this world.</b>

13:32.047 --> 13:33.047
<b>What's wrong?</b>

13:33.047 --> 13:35.267
<b>If I may ask a foolish question,</b>

13:35.267 --> 13:39.587
<b>what happened to our ambitions 
for the world we came from?</b>

13:41.757 --> 13:45.347
<b>None of that even matters, does it, Ice Rock?</b>

13:45.347 --> 13:48.887
<b>Our priority right now is carrying 
out the Demon Lord's orders,</b>

13:48.887 --> 13:49.557
<b>right?</b>

13:51.007 --> 13:53.017
<b>Indeed. Forgive me.</b>

13:53.707 --> 13:55.737
<b>All forces, charge!</b>

13:55.737 --> 13:57.497
<b>We'll wipe out that city</b>

13:57.497 --> 14:00.267
<b>and offer the despair and 
suffering of its people</b>

14:00.267 --> 14:03.157
<b>up to our Demon Lord!</b>

14:07.587 --> 14:09.117
<b>What will you be doing?</b>

14:09.117 --> 14:11.097
<b>I'll pass.</b>

14:11.097 --> 14:13.207
<b>You can have the honor of leading them.</b>

14:13.477 --> 14:16.167
<b>I see. Many thanks!</b>

14:21.547 --> 14:22.807
<b>Well, now...</b>

14:22.807 --> 14:25.377
<b>Time for me to go,</b>

14:25.377 --> 14:27.887
<b>so I can see to my own goals.</b>

14:33.767 --> 14:36.297
<b>Crush them in one fell swoop!</b>

14:46.967 --> 14:47.797
<b>What?!</b>

14:47.797 --> 14:49.177
<b>What happened?!</b>

14:49.177 --> 14:51.327
<b>We believe it was our enemy's spell!</b>

14:51.327 --> 14:52.217
<b>A spell?!</b>

14:52.217 --> 14:53.017
<b>Impossible!</b>

14:53.017 --> 14:55.917
<b>Such a large-scale spell doesn't exist!</b>

14:55.917 --> 14:57.877
<b>I find it hard to believe as well, but...</b>

15:01.827 --> 15:05.077
<b>The Orcs and Goblins are suffering,</b>

15:05.077 --> 15:08.887
<b>while pure Demons like 
us are gaining strength?</b>

15:08.887 --> 15:12.557
<b>Is this spell the work of someone 
aligned with evil forces?</b>

15:12.967 --> 15:14.487
<b>Sir Ice Rock,</b>

15:14.487 --> 15:17.837
<b>we believe this spell 
is the work of the Hero.</b>

15:16.777 --> 15:17.837
<b>Silence!</b>

15:17.837 --> 15:19.837
<b>Do not speak that name!</b>

15:19.837 --> 15:21.517
<b>The Hero? Oh?</b>

15:21.517 --> 15:25.097
<b>So you all really are from an RPG.</b>

15:30.937 --> 15:33.037
<b>Why, you! Who are you?!</b>

15:33.417 --> 15:35.117
<b>The warrior of ice?</b>

15:35.637 --> 15:39.207
<b>Then you must be Ice Rock, 
one of the Four Generals?</b>

15:39.207 --> 15:41.127
<b>How do you know my name?!</b>

15:41.127 --> 15:42.827
<b>Answer me, wench!</b>

15:42.827 --> 15:44.467
<b>Who are you?!</b>

15:44.467 --> 15:48.997
<b>I come from the 4X strategy 
game, <i>Eternal Nations</i>.</b>

15:48.997 --> 15:51.957
<b>I serve our great and mighty 
king, King Ira Takuto,</b>

15:52.457 --> 15:55.167
<b>and I am known as Sludge Atou.</b>

15:55.167 --> 15:56.437
<b>I am the one</b>

15:57.767 --> 16:00.467
<b>who will slaughter you all!</b>

16:06.017 --> 16:07.847
<b>Bring out every arrow we have!</b>

16:07.847 --> 16:10.497
<b>Evacuate the citizens to 
the northwestern blocks!</b>

16:11.137 --> 16:14.517
<b>Once we've secured an escape 
route, we'll abandon the city!</b>

16:15.997 --> 16:18.627
<b>There's no need for you to go that far.</b>

16:19.697 --> 16:21.427
<b>Elder Moltar!</b>

16:21.427 --> 16:23.927
<b>You have us here on your side.</b>

16:23.927 --> 16:25.827
<b>We're facing a huge army!</b>

16:25.827 --> 16:28.157
<b>They're in disarray from 
your spell right now,</b>

16:28.157 --> 16:29.547
<b>but that's just stalling them!</b>

16:29.547 --> 16:32.127
<b>Our current forces can't hope to repel them!</b>

16:32.947 --> 16:33.937
<b>Huh?</b>

16:38.857 --> 16:41.327
<b>That would be Lady Atou.</b>

16:41.327 --> 16:43.327
<b>Atou did that?</b>

16:43.327 --> 16:44.507
<b>Yes.</b>

16:44.507 --> 16:48.287
<b>That woman is the proud Hero of Mynoghra.</b>

16:48.287 --> 16:50.067
<b>Now that she's taken to the battlefield,</b>

16:50.067 --> 16:52.447
<b>there's no chance of defeat.</b>

16:52.937 --> 16:56.147
<b>I'm certain she'll claim the 
head of our enemy's general.</b>

16:56.147 --> 16:59.607
<b>Without their general, such an 
army is but a mob of riffraff.</b>

16:59.607 --> 17:03.417
<b>We can neutralize them easily 
enough with our current forces.</b>

17:12.167 --> 17:13.057
<b><i>So this...</i></b>

17:14.037 --> 17:15.667
<b><i>is Mynoghra?</i></b>

17:35.527 --> 17:37.957
<b>Why, you!</b>

17:41.647 --> 17:44.627
<b>It's just as King Takuto predicted.</b>

17:45.867 --> 17:47.687
<b><i>Their attack range?</i></b>

17:47.687 --> 17:48.377
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

17:48.377 --> 17:50.507
{Takuto

17:48.377 --> 17:54.517
Command

17:48.377 --> 17:56.807
