17:48.837 --> 17:52.817
<b><i>Battles in RPGs are between 
parties of small numbers.</i></b>

17:52.817 --> 17:56.877
<b><i>But in our 4X strategy game, 
combat is on the scale of armies.</i></b>

17:56.877 --> 18:01.227
<b><i>So a unit's attacks target the 
entirety of an enemy's army.</i></b>

18:01.527 --> 18:05.517
<b><i>This difference should work 
greatly to our advantage.</i></b>

18:05.517 --> 18:08.077
<b><i>It doesn't matter that you'll 
be facing a large army.</i></b>

18:08.077 --> 18:08.957
<b><i>Atou,</i></b>

18:08.957 --> 18:10.567
<b><i>they're no match for you!</i></b>

18:13.547 --> 18:15.607
<b>Why do you interfere?!</b>

18:15.607 --> 18:17.867
<b>You are evil as well!</b>

18:17.867 --> 18:22.087
<b>You should be bowing before our Demon Lord and 
join us in spreading his reign to the world!</b>

18:22.337 --> 18:23.217
<b>What?</b>

18:23.217 --> 18:25.297
<b>Spread his reign to the world?</b>

18:25.297 --> 18:28.467
<b>Oh, you're talking about 
world conquest, right?</b>

18:28.467 --> 18:30.097
<b>Yes!</b>

18:30.097 --> 18:32.967
<b>We seek to create a world for us Demons!</b>

18:32.967 --> 18:34.947
<b>One without humans!</b>

18:33.347 --> 18:36.057
<b>What would be the point of doing that?</b>

18:36.377 --> 18:40.567
<b>It's already rough enough with the 
mountain of work I have to handle now.</b>

18:40.567 --> 18:42.717
<b>And that's just for a normal nation.</b>

18:42.717 --> 18:44.217
<b>Yet you want the world?</b>

18:44.217 --> 18:47.687
<b>Do you love doing paperwork that much?</b>

18:47.687 --> 18:48.917
<b>Paper...?</b>

18:48.917 --> 18:50.657
<b>Huh? You don't understand?</b>

18:50.967 --> 18:52.807
<b>Oh, I get it.</b>

18:52.807 --> 18:56.067
<b>Your character background wasn't 
very fleshed out, was it?</b>

18:56.067 --> 19:00.617
<b>No one cares about an RPG's mid-boss 
once they're defeated after all.</b>

19:00.617 --> 19:01.977
<b>Ahr...?</b>

19:01.977 --> 19:04.087
<b>What have you been blathering about?!</b>

19:04.087 --> 19:05.047
<b>Oh?</b>

19:05.047 --> 19:07.277
<b>You should remember that part, shouldn't you?</b>

19:07.277 --> 19:11.587
<b>You've been defeated over and 
over and over again, haven't you?</b>

19:12.057 --> 19:13.337
<b>By the Hero?</b>

