19:21.697 --> 19:23.407
<b>Silence! Silence!</b>

19:23.407 --> 19:24.857
<b>Silence!</b>

19:25.927 --> 19:27.447
<b>I knew it!</b>

19:27.447 --> 19:30.197
<b>You do remember it, just like we do.</b>

19:31.557 --> 19:34.317
<b>By the way, I'd like you 
to tell me something.</b>

19:36.377 --> 19:39.617
<b>How does it feel to exist 
solely to be defeated?</b>

19:39.617 --> 19:41.987
<b>No! No! No! No!</b>

19:41.987 --> 19:43.877
<b>You still continue to deny it?!</b>

19:43.877 --> 19:45.587
<b>How laughable!</b>

19:45.587 --> 19:46.777
<b>My name is!</b>

19:46.777 --> 19:48.977
<b>Ice Rock, the Frost General!</b>

19:48.977 --> 19:53.137
<b>I am the one who crushes all who 
oppose our great and mighty ruler!</b>

19:53.137 --> 19:55.157
<b>All who defy the Demon Lord!</b>

19:55.927 --> 19:58.297
<b>Ha! The Demon Lord?!</b>

19:58.297 --> 20:00.877
<b>The world has only one king—</b>

20:00.877 --> 20:03.707
<b>our King Ira Takuto!</b>

20:03.707 --> 20:04.647
<b>Come at me!</b>

20:05.687 --> 20:10.437
<b>Unleash whatever you believe is your 
strongest attack, and suffer pathetic defeat!</b>

20:10.437 --> 20:13.187
<b>Take this!</b>

20:16.697 --> 20:19.487
<b>Glacial Decapitation!</b>

20:19.487 --> 20:20.967
<b>Fool.</b>

20:20.967 --> 20:23.867
<b>There's no way such a 
broadcasted strike would hit.</b>

20:26.817 --> 20:27.877
<b>Impossible!</b>

20:27.877 --> 20:30.987
<b>There's no way so little 
ice would halt my movement!</b>

20:41.887 --> 20:43.087
<b>Did you see that?</b>

20:43.087 --> 20:45.997
<b>That was my most powerful strike!</b>

20:50.547 --> 20:52.857
<b>To think that's not enough to defeat you...</b>

20:53.527 --> 20:54.487
<b>Die!</b>

20:56.247 --> 20:59.907
<b>Long live... the Demon Lord...</b>

21:03.457 --> 21:05.887
<b>What a shameful mess!</b>

21:05.887 --> 21:08.577
<b>I'm supposed to be King Takuto's hero!</b>

21:13.047 --> 21:15.017
<b>And what was that?!</b>

21:15.017 --> 21:16.337
<b>That attack at the end?!</b>

21:16.337 --> 21:18.667
<b>That was just impossible!</b>

21:19.387 --> 21:20.307
<b>Huh?</b>

21:20.307 --> 21:26.267
You have acquired an ability from Ice Rock, the Frost General.

21:20.307 --> 21:26.267
Glacial Decapitation
 Unleash a powerful, ice-element attack that's
 guaranteed to hit. The backlash will prevent you
 from moving for a while.

21:25.287 --> 21:26.267
<b>Huh?</b>

21:26.557 --> 21:28.727
<b>Guaranteed to hit?</b>

21:28.727 --> 21:31.137
<b>That's cheating!</b>

21:33.157 --> 21:36.967
<b>So this is what it means to 
fight a different genre of game.</b>

21:36.967 --> 21:40.527
<b>The enemies are operating under 
different mechanics than we are.</b>

21:41.087 --> 21:42.387
<b>How troublesome.</b>

21:44.717 --> 21:48.007
<b>Either way, it's time to report!</b>

21:48.007 --> 21:49.957
<b><i>King Takuto, I'm finished!</i></b>

21:49.957 --> 21:51.807
<b><i>The enemy was one of the Four Generals,</i></b>

21:51.807 --> 21:54.137
<b><i>and while I took a slight blow,</i></b>

21:54.137 --> 21:55.207
<b><i>I finished him off proper—</i></b>

21:55.567 --> 21:56.327
<b>Huh?!</b>

22:04.367 --> 22:07.127
<b>There's an enemy in Mynoghra?!</b>

